WEBVTT

00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:09.610
Sankai Festival

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:07.230
<i>Today is the school festival.</i>

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:11.850
<i>All kinds of people come 
to the school festival.</i>

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.360
Monster
House

00:00:12.970 --> 00:00:16.370
<i>Some living, some not.</i>

00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:22.430
<i>At times, even non-person 
things start to move.</i>

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:56.800
Café

00:02:01.240 --> 00:02:02.680
Welcome.

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:05.170
Please have a seat over here.

00:02:05.170 --> 00:02:07.320
Are you ready to order?

00:02:09.550 --> 00:02:12.760
Rokudou-kun, can you help me with something?

00:02:12.760 --> 00:02:13.400
Sure.

00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:15.990
I'll help, too, Mamiya-san.

00:02:15.990 --> 00:02:17.570
Huh? But...

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.880
Jumonji-kun, aren't you in charge 
of attracting customers outside?

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:22.410
You can't come back inside.

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:27.220
I'm going to go attract customers.

00:02:28.210 --> 00:02:33.250
The Wig's Disappointment
 and the Pumpkin's Temptation

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:39.660
What's wrong?

00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:41.970
I just sensed something ominous.

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:44.210
I'm going to throw out the trash.

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:49.020
What the?!

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.610
Not again!

00:02:59.810 --> 00:03:02.470
What is that thing? Gross!

00:03:02.470 --> 00:03:04.250
Dude, again?

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:06.010
Shoot it down!

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.750
The wig's harassing you?

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:12.570
Strange things have been happening 
ever since we recently cleaned out

00:03:12.570 --> 00:03:15.420
the drama club storage room.

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:20.210
We threw out a bunch of props we didn't need.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:25.350
Ever since, a wig that we're sure we 
threw out keeps coming back, and...

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:30.290
Wow.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:34.770
It jumps onto people's heads 
by itself, just like that.

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:37.330
Our play is coming up!

00:03:37.330 --> 00:03:40.870
We can't perform with this thing around!

00:03:42.250 --> 00:03:44.170
I see, I understand.

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:45.070
Is it an evil spirit?

00:03:45.070 --> 00:03:49.470
No, from the looks of it, 
it's a Tsukumogami wig.

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:54.420
In which case, it'll be quickest 
to talk to it directly.

00:03:55.640 --> 00:04:01.300
<i>A Tsukumogami is a tool who has, 
over a long period of time, gained a soul.</i>

00:04:01.810 --> 00:04:03.390
Tsukumogami Sticker!

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:13.790
Tsukumogami                                  Sticker

00:04:04.730 --> 00:04:09.910
<i>A Tsukumogami Sticker is a handy shinigami 
tool that sells for just 99 yen.</i>

00:04:09.910 --> 00:04:14.310
<i>Paste it on, and you can hear 
what a tool is thinking.</i>

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:21.490
My part got cut, dammit!

00:04:22.280 --> 00:04:23.210
Oh?

00:04:26.120 --> 00:04:30.330
So the wig will be content 
if it gets to play its part?

00:04:30.330 --> 00:04:31.950
Yeah, but...

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:38.000
It doesn't seem to be able to remember what 
the play was about or what its part was.

00:04:38.930 --> 00:04:44.220
Heh, I doubt it was an important 
part, if it got cut so easily.

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:47.340
Why you little...

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.720
Holy Ash!

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:56.990
It's a blond wig, so 
it must be set overseas.

00:04:56.990 --> 00:04:59.550
There's a blond girl in it.

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:03.970
I checked the programs of every play since 
we were founded, but they're all western.

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:05.700
It'll be hard to narrow it down.

00:05:06.130 --> 00:05:08.020
Don't you remember anything?

00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:10.080
Even if it's something trivial.

00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:13.580
I can't remember anything.

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:15.960
Oh, just one thing!

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:16.830
What?

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:18.460
One of the props

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:21.840
was a glass shoe.

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:28.890
Back when the club was founded, 
they played Cinderella

00:05:28.890 --> 00:05:31.010
at the request of a preschool nearby.

00:05:31.860 --> 00:05:33.270
That's a big hint.

00:05:33.920 --> 00:05:35.770
Speak up sooner, damn you.

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:40.410
So it'll be satisfied if it 
can finish playing Cinderella.

00:05:40.410 --> 00:05:41.860
Okay, let's start!

00:05:42.420 --> 00:05:43.330
Weeheehee!

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:44.860
Weeheehee! Weeheehee!

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:46.950
What?!

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.070
No way!

00:05:48.070 --> 00:05:51.080
I'd never wear that creepy wig.

00:05:51.420 --> 00:05:52.630
D'oh!

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:55.700
Fine, I'll have to do it, 
since I'm the president.

00:05:55.830 --> 00:05:58.170
Hell, no!

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.220
Girls! Girls!

00:06:01.220 --> 00:06:02.890
It has to be a girl!

00:06:02.890 --> 00:06:04.560
Girls! Girls!

00:06:04.560 --> 00:06:05.220
Huh?

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:10.680
Not Mamiya-san.

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:13.480
I can't rest! I can't rest!

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:14.540
Shut up!

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.810
Want me to End Task you?!

00:06:14.540 --> 00:06:16.810
Seal

00:06:17.100 --> 00:06:21.150
I don't mind wearing it, but I can't act.

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:22.710
Mamiya-san.

00:06:22.710 --> 00:06:24.040
You'll do it?

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:25.630
Woohoo!

00:06:25.630 --> 00:06:27.110
I guess we don't have a choice.

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:29.900
Sorry I'm not a good actor.

00:06:29.900 --> 00:06:32.760
Fine, I'll put up with your bad acting.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:38.350
Don't push it, or I'll send you to Hell.

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:39.580
I got carried away.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:41.330
Reserved for
Drama Club!

00:06:44.660 --> 00:06:46.630
Let's begin!

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:57.720
I want to go to the castle ball.

00:06:57.720 --> 00:07:00.200
Mamiya-san's so cute!

00:06:59.870 --> 00:07:11.240
Cinderella

00:07:00.200 --> 00:07:03.910
Miraculously, the first draft 
of the play was preserved.

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:05.190
The first draft?

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:06.150
In other words,

00:07:06.150 --> 00:07:10.080
it's the scenario before the wig's 
part was dropped for whatever reason.

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:11.240
I see.

00:07:11.790 --> 00:07:14.160
Now we can reenact the past!

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:16.120
The wig will surely be satisfied!

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:22.540
I'm going to cast the spell.

00:07:22.540 --> 00:07:24.870
Woohoo! Here we go!

00:07:26.050 --> 00:07:27.700
Umm... Pumpkin!

00:07:28.350 --> 00:07:29.170
Yes!

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:34.340
Mrowrrr

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:34.340
Poof

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:33.660
Mrowrrr!

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:36.540
Wow.

00:07:36.540 --> 00:07:38.280
A hearse carriage monster?!

00:07:38.280 --> 00:07:40.230
I think it's supposed to 
be a pumpkin carriage.

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:42.850
Hurry!

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:47.980
Hurry! Hurry!

00:07:45.820 --> 00:07:47.980
You're getting kind of excited.

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:50.990
I'm going to cast the next spell, now.

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:54.200
Cinderella dress up!

00:07:54.470 --> 00:07:56.530
Wrong!

00:07:57.050 --> 00:07:58.650
Fool!

00:07:58.650 --> 00:07:59.500
Oh, my.

00:08:00.550 --> 00:08:02.460
A beautiful spin-back kick!

00:08:04.030 --> 00:08:06.930
What are you doing, 
cutting corners like that?!

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:10.900
But according to the scenario...

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:14.470
Huh, the stage direction is scratched out.

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:17.000
Could it be...

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:20.860
That's it.

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:25.060
Something didn't seem right since 
the moment I put on this wig.

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:28.280
It <i>is</i> crossed out.

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:30.210
What did it say?

00:08:30.210 --> 00:08:34.490
"The pumpkin becomes a carriage, 
and the mice become horses."

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:35.860
But gee...

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:39.120
The stage is all filled up with the carriage.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:40.730
We don't need a horse, do we?

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:44.080
Imbeciles!

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:44.750
Oh, my.

00:08:46.100 --> 00:08:47.320
I remember now.

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:48.750
That's what happened.

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:51.720
We don't need a horse, do we?

00:08:51.720 --> 00:08:53.380
Horse, you're cut!

00:08:55.140 --> 00:08:57.410
D'oh!

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:00.830
So it was the horse's tail.

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:04.020
No wonder it didn't feel quite right.

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:09.770
Cinderella

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:08.330
Neigh!

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:09.770
That should do it.

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:14.900
Now we'll be able to do 
the performance in peace.

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:15.670
Sure.

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:18.280
Good, that's a relief.

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:18.990
Yes!

00:09:22.400 --> 00:09:24.290
Is something wrong, Rokudou-kun?

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:25.790
No, nothing.

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:30.130
Class 1-4
Café

00:09:26.390 --> 00:09:28.840
We better get back to class now.

00:09:28.840 --> 00:09:30.130
We should.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:32.630
Crepes

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:32.630
Yakisoba

00:09:38.910 --> 00:09:41.140
<i>That thing I sensed...</i>

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:49.210
<i>That wasn't a Tsukumogami. 
It felt like something else.</i>

00:09:49.210 --> 00:09:50.470
Rinne-sama!

00:09:58.740 --> 00:09:59.740
Help me.

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:01.490
Huh?

00:10:01.490 --> 00:10:04.290
Café

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:04.290
I'm back.

00:10:04.510 --> 00:10:06.660
Welcome back, Sakura-chan.

00:10:06.660 --> 00:10:07.950
That took a while.

00:10:07.950 --> 00:10:10.230
Sorry. Did it get busy?

00:10:10.230 --> 00:10:12.020
Nah, not at all.

00:10:12.020 --> 00:10:14.300
Hey, look over there.

00:10:16.360 --> 00:10:20.250
It's like a dream that you'd 
come talk to me, Senpai.

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:22.820
It hasn't been since 
I graduated middle school, huh?

00:10:24.580 --> 00:10:26.670
What's up with Mari-chan?

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:29.660
She's been talking to herself the whole time.

00:10:29.660 --> 00:10:30.270
Huh?

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:32.520
How've you been, Senpai?

00:10:32.770 --> 00:10:37.360
Great. I had a sudden urge 
to meet up with you, Mari.

00:10:39.630 --> 00:10:43.380
<i>Rika-chan and Miho-chan can't see him.</i>

00:10:44.380 --> 00:10:45.910
<i>Is he a spirit?</i>

00:10:47.270 --> 00:10:49.750
I smell an evil spirit.

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:51.300
Tsubasa-kun.

00:10:52.520 --> 00:10:54.040
Holy Ash!

00:10:56.540 --> 00:10:57.920
What the...

00:10:58.440 --> 00:11:00.390
What was that for?!

00:11:06.500 --> 00:11:08.140
What was that?

00:11:08.590 --> 00:11:10.890
<i>The spirit's gone.</i>

00:11:12.650 --> 00:11:14.520
To Mari
 I'll be waiting on the rooftop.

00:11:15.030 --> 00:11:16.230
Senpai.

00:11:19.050 --> 00:11:20.000
Mari-chan.

00:11:20.980 --> 00:11:22.030
You're not getting away!

00:11:23.280 --> 00:11:24.610
Wait!

00:11:25.710 --> 00:11:27.540
What are you going to do about this?!

00:11:27.980 --> 00:11:29.310
Senpai.

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:31.540
Where are you?

00:11:31.880 --> 00:11:33.730
Over here.

00:11:35.350 --> 00:11:36.290
Senpai.

00:11:37.190 --> 00:11:39.040
Mari-chan, no!

00:11:40.550 --> 00:11:41.720
Rokudou-kun.

00:11:51.240 --> 00:11:52.640
A pumpkin?

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:54.980
Were you trying to make her jump?

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:57.810
Darn, I was so close.

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:03.510
Tricking people who aren't supposed 
to die into the afterlife is dirty.

00:12:03.510 --> 00:12:05.570
You must be a Damashigami.

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:07.200
<i>A Damashigami?</i>

00:12:09.220 --> 00:12:11.510
I have a pesky problem now.

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:17.340
I tried to jump off?

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:19.090
You don't remember?

00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:21.720
Mari-chan, who was that guy?

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:25.050
Oh, that's Kimura-senpai from middle school.

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:28.640
He was so awesome. Everyone admired him.

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:33.560
I sent him a love letter, too, but he 
graduated before I ever got a reply.

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:37.940
And then all of a sudden, 
he came to see me today.

00:12:37.940 --> 00:12:40.220
I feel like something's about to begin.

00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:42.240
Not a worry in the world, huh?

00:12:42.510 --> 00:12:44.990
And now, I have some bad news.

00:12:49.070 --> 00:12:50.870
Senpai's already dead?

00:12:51.230 --> 00:12:53.250
Yeah, in an accident last year.

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:59.000
And I met this weird pumpkin head 
when I was supposed to go to heaven.

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:00.500
Who are you?

00:13:02.760 --> 00:13:04.810
I like that face of yours!

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:10.130
He swapped faces with me.

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:13.610
Then you're...

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:14.730
I'm Kimura.

00:13:14.730 --> 00:13:16.460
I found him and protected him earlier.

00:13:17.970 --> 00:13:19.860
What are you guys talking about?

00:13:20.250 --> 00:13:23.660
<i>Mari-chan can't see the pumpkin head spirit.</i>

00:13:24.500 --> 00:13:26.620
I heard Kimura-senpai's here!

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:27.800
Let's go see him!

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:30.740
It's the girls from my middle school.

00:13:31.360 --> 00:13:32.620
Let's go see.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:39.960
Hey guys, I came to visit you.

00:13:40.860 --> 00:13:42.150
Senpai!

00:13:42.150 --> 00:13:44.000
Kimura-kun!

00:13:44.000 --> 00:13:44.800
He's so fine!

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:46.220
He's gorgeous!

00:13:46.830 --> 00:13:47.860
Those girls?

00:13:47.860 --> 00:13:50.010
They're the ones that sent me love letters.

00:13:50.010 --> 00:13:53.520
That bastard, he's using my beautiful face!

00:13:55.860 --> 00:14:00.020
Come with me, let's party!

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:06.680
Senpai!

00:14:06.410 --> 00:14:07.280
No!

00:14:07.560 --> 00:14:09.170
I can't just stand here.

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:10.680
Mari-chan.

00:14:10.680 --> 00:14:12.950
Let go, I'm going with them!

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:15.920
Wait!

00:14:25.270 --> 00:14:26.660
Farewell!

00:14:29.050 --> 00:14:34.970
Oden

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:30.410
He vanished.

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:32.680
Was it just me...

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:34.970
...or did a bunch of girls just vanish?

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:38.280
Rokudou-kun, what will happen to 
those girls that vanished?

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:45.730
Don't Damashigamis take living people to 
the afterlife so they can make their quota?

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:49.450
Unless we do something, Mari-chan 
and the other girls are going to...

00:14:49.450 --> 00:14:50.780
I set something up.

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:53.030
He'll be back.

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:56.160
I'm not letting him get away.

00:14:56.710 --> 00:15:00.960
I can't let a Damashigami defeat me.

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:07.960
Here, have some snacks.

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:10.170
Good boy.

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:15.430
Rokudou, are you sure the 
Damashigami is coming back?

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:17.970
Yeah, no doubt.

00:15:18.320 --> 00:15:19.770
What's he doing?

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:20.640
Who knows.

00:15:26.730 --> 00:15:27.400
How do I look?

00:15:28.000 --> 00:15:28.980
Jeez!

00:15:28.980 --> 00:15:30.820
What do you want me to say?

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:33.200
I borrowed a costume from the drama club.

00:15:33.900 --> 00:15:35.170
Rokudou-kun.

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:37.450
It looks good. You're cute!

00:15:37.970 --> 00:15:39.990
Damashigami are greedy.

00:15:39.990 --> 00:15:42.830
He'll take my bait, no doubt.

00:15:43.150 --> 00:15:47.900
By bait, do you mean the thing you 
threw at him just before he vanished?

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:52.920
"I've always loved you, Kimura-senpai. 
Please make me your girlfriend.

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:56.330
-- girl from class 1-4"

00:15:57.460 --> 00:15:58.140
He's here.

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:02.520
Who's the girl that sent me this love letter?

00:16:04.190 --> 00:16:05.520
Love letter?

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:07.770
That love letter's the bait?

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.650
I wrote it really fast.

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:11.290
<i>What?!</i>

00:16:11.290 --> 00:16:14.040
<i>You wrote all that in the 
middle of all that chaos?!</i>

00:16:14.600 --> 00:16:16.490
<i>Rokudou the Terrible.</i>

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:21.510
So...

00:16:23.800 --> 00:16:24.940
It must be you!

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:27.290
Mamiya-san!

00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:29.000
What's going on?

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:30.670
I'm so happy.

00:16:30.670 --> 00:16:33.170
You're totally my type.

00:16:34.120 --> 00:16:35.930
Nah, this is a mistake.

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:42.600
I like you, Kimura-senpai.

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:44.820
You're a pushy little kitten, aren't you?

00:16:44.820 --> 00:16:47.030
They say to "never say no"!

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:49.670
Wait, Rinne-sama!

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:51.930
Bastard, give me back my face!

00:16:51.930 --> 00:16:54.240
Leave Mamiya-san behind, you!

00:16:57.860 --> 00:16:58.710
Huh?

00:16:58.710 --> 00:17:00.290
Where did Sakura-chan and the others go?

00:17:00.290 --> 00:17:04.120
<i>Normal people can't see Damashigami.</i>

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:13.030
Where are we?

00:17:13.030 --> 00:17:15.380
Everyone's having a good time.

00:17:16.900 --> 00:17:17.950
I love you.

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:19.850
I'm so happy.

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:20.810
I love you.

00:17:20.810 --> 00:17:22.670
Really? I love you, too.

00:17:22.670 --> 00:17:23.820
I love you.

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:25.140
Kimura-senpai!

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:28.560
<i>So many Kimura-senpai-sans.</i>

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:31.700
<i>Are these all the Damashigami's illusion?</i>

00:17:31.700 --> 00:17:33.570
Let us out, damn you!

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:36.610
Tsubasa-kun.

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:38.060
Kimura-senpai-san.

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:39.160
Rokumon-chan, you too?

00:17:39.160 --> 00:17:40.260
Mamiya-san!

00:17:40.260 --> 00:17:41.080
Help us!

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:42.940
Sakura-sama!

00:17:42.940 --> 00:17:44.690
Oh, wait. I'm out.

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:51.740
It's set up to capture any man that comes in.

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:53.170
Wow.

00:17:53.170 --> 00:17:54.300
I see.

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:59.950
So you gather your victims here, and you 
send them to the afterlife all at once.

00:18:00.710 --> 00:18:01.640
What?

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:02.890
Rokumon.

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:04.890
Yes, Rinne-sama.

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:11.520
Cast the light of day on trickery and expose 
them for what they are, Hakujitsutou!

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:13.560
Damashigami, defeated!

00:18:19.540 --> 00:18:20.570
What is this?

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:21.530
A doll?!

00:18:22.060 --> 00:18:23.910
This light...

00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:27.150
My face!

00:18:27.150 --> 00:18:28.540
He turned into a pumpkin.

00:18:31.680 --> 00:18:33.110
Dude, your face.

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:34.140
It's back.

00:18:34.140 --> 00:18:35.590
My face!

00:18:35.590 --> 00:18:37.010
There he is!

00:18:37.400 --> 00:18:38.710
Kimura-senpai!

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:40.250
He's over there!

00:18:40.720 --> 00:18:43.600
How could you?!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:47.700
Get him!

00:19:02.520 --> 00:19:04.080
Rinne-sama!

00:19:04.600 --> 00:19:06.830
Take that! And that!

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:08.070
Rokumon.

00:19:09.930 --> 00:19:11.040
They don't give up.

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:16.300
A girl deserves plenty of service.

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:19.050
<i>He still thinks he's a girl.</i>

00:19:20.510 --> 00:19:21.510
Here I go!

00:19:27.860 --> 00:19:31.140
I'm going for a strike this time!

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:52.870
You're a girl; you shouldn't be so violent.

00:19:53.170 --> 00:19:54.460
I'm not a girl.

00:19:55.940 --> 00:19:58.340
S-Say what?!

00:19:59.030 --> 00:20:01.610
I guide the lost souls of the 
deceased to their proper end.

00:20:01.610 --> 00:20:03.470
I don't allow fraudulent deaths.

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:04.880
I'm a shinigami!

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:08.950
Rokudou-kun looks awesome.

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:11.640
<i>If only he weren't wearing a skirt.</i>

00:20:12.080 --> 00:20:15.670
Don't go thinking you've won.

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:17.570
What?

00:20:17.570 --> 00:20:18.540
Behold!

00:20:19.250 --> 00:20:20.990
Kimura-senpai!

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:22.470
Kimura-kun!

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:26.270
Wake up, everyone.

00:20:26.270 --> 00:20:28.210
This person's dead!

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:30.200
I don't care!

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:32.160
I'll die with him!

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:34.460
Take me with you, Kimura-senpai!

00:20:36.120 --> 00:20:42.380
You're not getting out of this place until 
those girls end their desire for him.

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:44.590
Guys...

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:49.560
You can't, everyone.

00:20:50.110 --> 00:20:52.640
I'm flattered that you think 
of me that way, but...

00:20:53.040 --> 00:20:54.520
Kimura-senpai.

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:56.130
I'm sorry.

00:20:56.800 --> 00:21:00.480
If you're going to love me, 
love me when you're over forty.

00:21:00.770 --> 00:21:01.730
What?

00:21:03.480 --> 00:21:05.660
I like mature women.

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:08.620
D'ooooooooh...

00:21:11.850 --> 00:21:13.480
Boom!

00:21:13.480 --> 00:21:14.790
Oh look, he's doomed.

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:17.880
<i>Kaboom!</i>

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:27.140
<i>And so, with the demise of the Damashigami, 
we were able to return to our own world.</i>

00:21:27.140 --> 00:21:29.240
Sankai Festival

00:21:31.820 --> 00:21:33.500
Can you make it alone?

00:21:33.500 --> 00:21:35.810
Yeah. Thanks for everything.

00:21:41.110 --> 00:21:43.380
All contestants, gather here.

00:21:46.860 --> 00:21:52.660
<i>But it still bothers me what 
Rokudou-kun said at the time.</i>

00:21:54.400 --> 00:21:58.170
I can't let a Damashigami defeat me.

00:21:58.780 --> 00:22:02.330
<i>I don't think it's about justice.</i>

00:22:02.890 --> 00:22:06.170
<i>I think he has a deeper reason.</i>

00:22:10.610 --> 00:22:13.390
And the winner of the drag contest is...

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:15.600
Rokudou Rinne-kun!

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:16.970
Congratulations!

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:21.020
Sankai High School Drag Contest

00:22:16.970 --> 00:22:19.700
Your prize is a dozen cup noodles!

00:22:21.300 --> 00:22:23.110
Go, Rinne-sama!

00:22:23.110 --> 00:22:24.620
When did he...

00:22:24.620 --> 00:22:26.400
He's completely on top of things.

00:22:29.690 --> 00:22:30.990
Why, thank you.

00:24:01.040 --> 00:24:25.980
Next Episode:
 Damashigami Company

00:24:02.740 --> 00:24:03.540
What is it, Rokumon?

00:24:03.820 --> 00:24:04.650
Do you have a cold?

00:24:04.650 --> 00:24:05.940
You have snot coming out.

00:24:05.940 --> 00:24:06.790
Wipe it with a tissue.

00:24:06.790 --> 00:24:08.300
I mustn't, Rinne-sama.

00:24:08.300 --> 00:24:13.720
The only time one can use such a luxury item 
is when one bangs their toe on a dresser,

00:24:13.720 --> 00:24:16.640
and when one is torn apart from their family.

00:24:16.640 --> 00:24:18.170
Sorry, Rokumon.

00:24:18.170 --> 00:24:21.060
If only it weren't for him and 
<i>that</i> thing, I could buy tissues...

00:24:22.310 --> 00:24:25.980
Next time on <i>Rin-ne</i>: "Damashigami Company"
